{
  "description": "Schema fixtures plus normative replay scenarios. Request ID is single-use per attempt and op: identical body digest replays retained reply or rejoins in-flight wait; changed digest refuses pairing-request-conflict. A new complete ID after successful completion refuses pairing-claim-invalid without another grant.",
  "cases": [
